# November 26, 2026: Walla Walla, Washington (region wa), from the names in one walk-through video about the city's old
# buildings (Old World Exploration, August 2024; the record is source/videos/20240816_oZGim67RzLU.md). The video was used
# only as a list of names; every fact below comes from a source opened while writing: National Register forms (NPGallery,
# text layer read), Wikipedia as raw text and its Walla Walla County Register list, the Pacific Coast Architecture Database,
# SAH Archipedia, Walla Walla 2020's building history reports (ww2020.net), courthouses.co, the Fort Walla Walla Museum's
# own page, and an architects' project page for Sharpstein School.
